  "prefLabel": "En 401.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 401.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to prescribe rules and to establish standard procedures, general business rules, and guidelines for telephone utilities in order to enable providers to comply with relevant statutes and commission orders and to provide an opportunity for telecommunications carriers, as defined under federal law, to register in New Hampshire to obtain evidence of their rights and obligations under the Communications Act of 1934, as amended.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en400.html"
